/math-academy-id "q-75635" :question/problem "Calculate $CB+CA$, where\n\n$$\nA=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 3 & \\sqrt{2} \\\\ -1 & 3 & 2 \\\\ \\sqrt{3} & 2 & -1\\end{bmatrix},\\,B=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & -3 & -\\sqrt{2} \\\\ 1 & 1 & -2 \\\\ -\\sqrt{3} & -2 & 5\\end{bmatrix},\\,C=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 0 & \\frac{1}{2} & 0 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "We apply the distributive law \n\n$$\nCB+CA=C(B+A).\n$$\n\nSo, we calculate $B+A$ first:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}B+A & =\\begin{bmatrix}2 & -3 & -\\sqrt{2} \\\\ 1 & 1 & -2 \\\\ -\\sqrt{3} & -2 & 5\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 3 & \\sqrt{2} \\\\ -1 & 3 & 2 \\\\ \\sqrt{3} & 2 & -1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}4 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 4 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 4\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =4{I}_{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nFinally, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}CB+CA & =C(B+A) \\\\  & =C\\cdot 4{I}_{3} \\\\  & =4C \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}4 & 0 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 4 & 0 & 4\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id 17592186388090 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "a7ad52ce-d408-5390-b91f-c855274f39ea" :knowledge-point/title "Calculating a Matrix Product Using the Distributive Law"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "94eaedeb-d14a-5b50-9cc7-4ad0b2f03f7b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ \\sqrt{2} & -\\sqrt{2} & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id 17592186388092} {:answer/id #uuid "a956827c-a23e-56c4-9e5f-8c8e21ce2a36" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id 17592186388093} {:answer/id #uuid "3bdf7634-79ef-565d-858f-11943c4d903e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}0 & \\sqrt{2} & 0 \\\\ 0 & -\\sqrt{2} & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id 17592186388094} {:answer/id #uuid "ffa6a60f-415f-5b14-8f97-93d351d78b98" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.