\\begin{bmatrix}4 & 3 & 1 \\\\ -2 & -2 & 3 \\\\ -8 & 9 & 9\\end{bmatrix},\\,B=\\begin{bmatrix}8 & 1 & \\sqrt{3} \\\\ 3 & 5 & 1 \\\\ -2\\sqrt{7} & 1 & 3\\end{bmatrix},\\,C=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -3 & -1 \\\\ 2 & 7 & -3 \\\\ 8 & -9 & -4\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "We apply the distributive law\n\n$$\nAB+CB=(A+C)B.\n$$\n\nSo, we calculate $A+C$ first:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A+C & =\\begin{bmatrix}4 & 3 & 1 \\\\ -2 & -2 & 3 \\\\ -8 & 9 & 9\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -3 & -1 \\\\ 2 & 7 & -3 \\\\ 8 & -9 & -4\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}5 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 5 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 5\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =5{I}_{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nFinally, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}AB+CB & =(A+C)B \\\\  & =5{I}_{3}B \\\\  & =5B \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}40 & 5 & 5\\sqrt{3} \\\\ 15 & 25 & 5 \\\\ -10\\sqrt{7} & 5 & 15\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id 17592186485538 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "a7ad52ce-d408-5390-b91f-c855274f39ea" :knowledge-point/title "Calculating a Matrix Product Using the Distributive Law"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "3e233e64-3579-5308-adcf-0a3d34ed29d1" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1" :db/id 17592186484954}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "3e233e64-3579-5308-adcf-0a3d34ed29d1" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1" :db/id 17592186484954} :answer-field/id #uuid "47bcd799-0bc3-56c0-89be-70bb4ebb64ff" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id 17592186485398} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0ebeac41-ad6f-5e78-914d-22f0aeb5dd17" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3" :db/id 17592186484846}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "0ebeac41-ad6f-5e78-914d-22f0aeb5dd17" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3" :db/id 17592186484846} :answer-field/id #uuid "aae6b6ee-6c60-535b-9bd3-32a07cc14ec8" :ans